# Norn's own .gitignore -- authored for this solution specifically, not a
# stock template. Norn is a clean, modern Avalonia/.NET solution with no
# XAML, no ReSharper/TeamCity/Xamarin/BizTalk-era tooling anywhere in its
# history, so only what actually applies here is listed.

# .NET build output
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# Test output
TestResults/
*.trx

# OS cruft
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Editor
.idea/
*.swp
